(Lauren laughing)

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.050
How much do you love doing it?

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:19.888
It's second season now.

00:00:19.888 --> 00:00:21.437
- I love doing it.

00:00:21.437 --> 00:00:23.910
The kids are so fantastic.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.800
I just love them so much.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.780
And it just keeps you young, frankly,

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.488
to like be around kids.

00:00:29.488 --> 00:00:31.995
I know their hip music references and..

00:00:31.995 --> 00:00:33.208
- Yeah. Cool mom.

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:35.220
(both women laugh) Your
the cool mom on set.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.053
- It's really fun and

00:00:36.053 --> 00:00:40.080
and it's just nice to be in
such a sunny, happy show.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:41.010
- Oh my gosh, I love that.

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:42.150
I can watch it with my kids.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:42.983
- [Lauren] Yeah.

00:00:42.983 --> 00:00:44.149
- But also when they leave
I still watch it. I love it.

00:00:44.149 --> 00:00:45.270
(Lauren laughs)

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.130
Well, because Lauren and I share a love

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.189
