because who doesn't?

00:00:49.189 --> 00:00:51.701
And there was no segue there.

00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:52.710
(both women laugh)

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:57.112
It's time for another round
of "Planet or Pastry".

00:00:57.112 --> 00:01:00.539
♪ Planet or Pastry ♪

00:01:00.539 --> 00:01:02.621
(audience applauds)

00:01:02.621 --> 00:01:04.530
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.472
- You never thought
you'd sing pastry, huh?

00:01:06.472 --> 00:01:09.570
Lauren and I will be on the same team

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:12.000
