00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.940
So please welcome a very
funny man who you can see

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.510
in his Netflix show "Mo" and
in theaters in "Black Adam".

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:20.693
Here's Mo Amer everybody.

00:01:20.693 --> 00:01:25.693
(jazzy music and audience
applauding and cheering)

00:01:33.101 --> 00:01:33.934
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:33.934 --> 00:01:35.430
- Hope you guys are ready for this.

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:36.540
- So excited about your Netflix show

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:37.830
and also "Black Adam" was so good.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.690
Okay, so thank you for hosting.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:41.078
Could you explain the rules?

00:01:41.078 --> 00:01:43.650
- Yes, Kelly. On the table before you

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:46.560
are six covered plates with names on them.

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:50.970
Three of those are pastries
and three are real exoplanets.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:54.390
If you and Lauren can correctly
identify all three pastries

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:57.270
in only four guesses,
you will win each person

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:00.345
in the audience a prize worth $300.

00:02:00.345 --> 00:02:01.227
(audience cheering and applauding)

00:02:01.227 --> 00:02:02.477
- That's right.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.510
