there's another part of this.

00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:08.198
If you fail, you get NOTHING!

00:02:08.198 --> 00:02:09.576
(audience and Kelly laugh)

00:02:09.576 --> 00:02:10.409
- Papanasi.

00:02:10.409 --> 00:02:12.090
