00:02:14.127 --> 00:02:15.810
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:15.810 --> 00:02:16.740
- I hate her show.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.960
- The bonus is if you guess the pastries,

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:19.890
you get to eat them so..

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:20.850
- Okay. Okay.

00:02:20.850 --> 00:02:21.683
- [Mo] Easy.

00:02:21.683 --> 00:02:25.140
- Oh God, they all are
very hard words. Okay.

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.220
