00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.510
- That's okay.

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:29.160
Tikvenik, what do you think?

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.420
- I don't know. Are you ready? Okay. Okay.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:33.150
Tikvenik. Tikvenik.

