00:03:13.387 --> 00:03:15.053
(audience laughs) I'll
give you one more try.

00:03:15.053 --> 00:03:16.680
- Okay. Okay. Okay.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.833
No we aren't.. okay Papanasi.
Let's do it. Let's just do it.

00:03:18.833 --> 00:03:20.499
